cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this training material, please cite it as below."
title: "ROS 2 & LIMO Cobot Training"
abstract: >-
  A hands-on, 4-day beginner course on ROS 2 and the LIMO Cobot:
  Day 1 covers ROS/ROS 2 concepts with a turtlesim lab; Day 2 covers the
  ros2 CLI, workspaces, packages, and writing a first publisher/subscriber in
  Python; Day 3 covers LIMO Cobot hardware bring-up, driving, and sensing;
  Day 4 covers SLAM with Cartographer, navigation with Nav2, and control of
  the myCobot 280 M5 arm with MoveIt 2.
